# moe-stream ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** experimental research into MoE expert streaming.

**LEONES status:** P2/P3 radar.

## Summary

The project belongs to the second level of MoE runtime research and addresses the problem of loading only the experts required by the routing path.

## ODS fit

It should be compared with the more mature candidates before integration. Its main value is identifying techniques that could be incorporated into a common expert-streaming layer.